                %strong 26
                (1940), 356–359. (
                %a{:href => "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC1078188/pdf/pnas01616-0038.pdf"}> pdf
                )
            %li#Bastiani64
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andree+Bastiani"}> Andree Bastiani
